### 2.12 New Doctors Looking for Staff â€” public â€” GET /api/patients/doctors/looking-for-staff â€” DEPRECATED (kept for backward compat, Home no longer uses â€” leaks doctor details)
# Uses get_doctors_needing_staff() FUNCTION: newly approved (needs_staff=true only if shobi unavailable) + active + NOT EXISTS ACTIVE
# Public, no token. Expected 200: { doctors: [...] } â€” old logic without global check, keep for compat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/doctors/looking-for-staff

### 2.13 Staff Required â€” generic boolean (NEW â€” Home generic ad, no doctor details) â€” public â€” GET /api/patients/staff-required
# Uses is_staff_required() FUNCTION: TRUE only if EXISTS approved active doctor with NO ACTIVE assignment AND globally NO available staff (shobi unavailable)
# Rule: global e available thakle â†’ FALSE â†’ Home banner hidden (assign korar moto staff ase, ad dorkar nai)
#       shobi unavailable + kono doctor er ACTIVE nai â†’ TRUE â†’ Home shows "STAFF REQUIRED / Some doctors need staff / Register as Staff"
# Triggers: trg_doctor_needs_staff (pendingâ†’approved checks global), trg_sync_needs_staff_* (assignment), trg_staff_needs_sync (staff approve/suspend re-evaluates all)
# Public, no token. Expected 200: { staff_required: true } or { staff_required: false }
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/staff-required

### 2.14 Staff-Required toggle verification â€” manual (Cases with global check)
# Case A: Doctor approve + global 1 available (staff approved not assigned) â†’ GET /staff-required â†’ { staff_required: false } â€” NO banner
# Case B: Doctor approve + global 0 (shobi assigned/suspended) â†’ GET /staff-required â†’ { staff_required: true } â€” banner visible
# Case C: B visible â†’ POST /api/doctors/assign-staff (new staff approve kore assign) â†’ GET â†’ { staff_required: false } â€” disappears; shobi unavailable thakle abar true
# Case D: Multi â€” A has staff, B none, C has but global 0 â†’ true; global 1 thakle false (shobi unavailable tokhoni true)
# Case E: All have staff â†’ false; OR global 1 available thakle false (chahe doctor er staff na thakuk, assign korar moto staff ase)
# Verify: PATCH /api/admin/doctors/:id/approve (admin.http 3.2) then GET /staff-required; PATCH /api/admin/staff/:id/approve then GET again; check: SELECT is_staff_required(); SELECT doctor_id, needs_staff FROM doctor WHERE approval_status='approved'
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/staff-required

